{"id":2667,"slug":"happy-new-year-4","title":"Happy New Year!","date":"2016-01-01T10:00:15","url":"https://www.kamailio.org/w/2016/01/happy-new-year-4/","html":"<p>The amazing 2015 for <a href=\"//www.kamailio.org\">Kamailio</a> is done! Thank you everyone for contributing to it!</p>\n<p>Now it is the time to get prepared to fill the 2016, with interesting discussions on our forums, solving new RTC challenges, adding features in Kamailio and welcoming new contributors!</p>\n<p>We wish a healthy and prosperous year to all Kamailio friends! We are looking forward to meeting many of you at <a href=\"//www.kamailioworld.com\">Kamailio World Conference</a>, where we are going to celebrate 15 years of development for Kamailio project, as well as at other events around the globe!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.kamailio.org/w/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Best_Happy_New_Year_2016_Clip_Art.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-2668\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-2668\" src=\"https://www.kamailio.org/w/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Best_Happy_New_Year_2016_Clip_Art-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"Best_Happy_New_Year_2016_Clip_Art\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" srcset=\"https://www.kamailio.org/w/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Best_Happy_New_Year_2016_Clip_Art-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.kamailio.org/w/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Best_Happy_New_Year_2016_Clip_Art-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.kamailio.org/w/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Best_Happy_New_Year_2016_Clip_Art-75x42.jpg 75w, https://www.kamailio.org/w/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Best_Happy_New_Year_2016_Clip_Art.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.kamailio.org/w/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Happy_New_Year_Clip_art_2016.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-2669\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-2669\" src=\"https://www.kamailio.org/w/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Happy_New_Year_Clip_art_2016-272x300.jpg